      "id": "claim_5e4cb92e81ae4505af14b9e634ca1d2a",
      "statement": "The monorepo uses npm workspaces (`packages/*`) with six packages: kit (core), kit-ng (Angular adapter), kit-react (React adapter), kit-vue (Vue adapter), cli (CLI tool), and ulabase (thin wrapper for `npx ulabase`).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://package.json#L1-L18",
