      "statement": "All adapters and the CLI declare `@ulabase/kit` at exact version `0.0.0`, which forces npm to resolve from the local workspace rather than the registry. The release workflow rewrites these pins to the tag version before publishing all six packages (kit, kit-ng, kit-react, kit-vue, cli, ulabase).",
